# Leftover Supabase CLI state from before the move to Neon. The tracked files
# (config.toml, migrations, seed.sql) are gone; what remains is local cache that
# carries the old project ref and pooler URL. Safe to delete the whole folder
# once the Neon cutover is verified.
supabase/

.vercel
.env*
# Re-assert after the Vercel CLI's `.env*` above: last match wins in gitignore,
# and the template files carry no secrets and must stay committable.
!.env.example
!.env.sample
